                        <seg type="rubrication">Divine names; name of the donor; incipit of  <ref target="#ms_i1">Text 1</ref>
                           and <ref target="#ms_i3.1">Text 3.1</ref>; a few lines on the opening page of <ref target="#ms_i2">Text 2</ref>, alternating with
