                           abbreviations; elements of the punctuation signs; elements of Ethiopic
                           numerals; some words like <foreign xml:lang="gez">nǝgbaʾke ḫaba</foreign> (<locus target="#4ra"/>), <foreign xml:lang="gez">yǝbe</foreign> (<locus target="#6rb"/>), 
                           <foreign xml:lang="gez">kǝfl</foreign> (e.g., <locus target="#7vb #8rb #9ra"/>), <foreign xml:lang="gez">tǝrgʷāme</foreign> (<locus target="#20vb"/>), 
                           <foreign xml:lang="gez">fǝkkāre</foreign> (<locus target="#37vb"/>).</seg>
